# Deny by default: only locked Cargo metadata and Rust sources enter the build.
# This excludes .git, logs, local scripts, target, paper-runs, docs and fixtures.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!Dockerfile
!src/
!src/**

# Preserve these exclusions even if someone places local material under src/.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/target
**/target/**
**/paper-runs
**/paper-runs/**
**/scripts
**/scripts/**
